WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.733 --> 00:00:08.667
WAS NOT RELEASED.

00:00:08.668 --> 00:00:09.835
WE HAVE THE PICTURE.

00:00:09.836 --> 00:00:11.337
THANK YOU FOR COMING ON.

00:00:11.338 --> 00:00:13.639
WE JUST SHOWED THE PHOTOGRAPH OF

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:14.740
FORMER PRESIDENT BARACK OBAMA

00:00:14.741 --> 00:00:19.311
BEFORE HE WAS PRESIDENT WITH

00:00:19.312 --> 00:00:19.745
FARRAKHAN.

00:00:19.746 --> 00:00:21.780
YOU TOOK THE PICTURE.

00:00:21.781 --> 00:00:24.717
WHERE WITH US IT?

00:00:24.718 --> 00:00:26.151
&gt;&gt; IN THE CONGRESSIONAL BLACK

00:00:26.152 --> 00:00:27.720
CAUCUS MEETING ROOM.

00:00:35.729 --> 00:00:37.129
THE BASEMENT OF THE CAPITAL

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:39.465
WHERE MEETINGS ARE HELD AND

00:00:39.466 --> 00:00:41.367
THAT'S WHERE IT TOOK PLACE.

00:00:41.368 --> 00:00:42.601
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHY HAVE WE NEVER

00:00:42.602 --> 00:00:44.236
SEEN THIS PICTURE BEFORE?

00:00:44.237 --> 00:00:45.371
&gt;&gt; A COUPLE THINGS.

00:00:45.372 --> 00:00:57.616
I WAS HONOR-BOUND.

00:00:57.617 --> 00:01:00.719
A MEMBER FROM THE BLACK CAUCUS

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.855
SAID WE HAVE TO HAVE THE PICTURE

00:01:11.965 --> 00:01:19.488
TO MINISTER FARRAKHAN AS

00:01:19.489 --> 00:01:19.672
TO MINISTER FARRAKHAN A

00:01:19.673 --> 00:01:19.972
TO MINISTER FARRAKHAN'S

00:01:20.106 --> 00:01:20.606
TO MINISTER FARRAKHAN'S CHIEF OF

00:01:20.607 --> 00:01:23.342
STAFF AND GAVE THE ORIGINAL DISK

00:01:23.343 --> 00:01:27.212
TO HIM AND IN A SENSE SWORE

00:01:27.213 --> 00:01:29.882
MYSELF TO SECRECY BECAUSE I MADE

00:01:29.883 --> 00:01:31.150
A COPY FOR MY LIFE.

00:01:31.151 --> 00:01:39.959
IT'S MY PICTURE, MY ART, MY

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:40.659
INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:44.596
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BUT WHY WOULD THEY

00:01:44.597 --> 00:01:46.799
NOT WANT THE PICTURE TO COME

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:48.334
OUT?

00:01:48.335 --> 00:01:51.337
&gt;&gt; NOT SO MUCH THE NATION OF

00:01:51.338 --> 00:01:53.772
ISLAM BUT PERHAPS THE BLACK

00:01:53.773 --> 00:01:54.106
CAUCUS.

00:01:54.107 --> 00:01:55.741
THIS WAS 2005, NOW.

00:01:55.742 --> 00:01:58.377
HE'D JUST BEEN IN THE OFFICE A

00:01:58.378 --> 00:01:58.877
FEW MONTHS.

00:01:58.878 --> 00:02:01.146
THE IDEA -- AND IN FACT HE HAD

00:02:06.186 --> 00:02:07.152
IN CHICAGO.

00:02:07.153 --> 00:02:08.954
THE MEMBERS OF THE NATION OF

00:02:08.955 --> 00:02:11.957
ISLAM HELPED HIM IN HIS SENATE

00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:12.691
CAMPAIGN ON THE SOUTH SIDE OF

00:02:12.692 --> 00:02:14.526
CHICAGO.

00:02:14.527 --> 00:02:18.364
I THINK AS PEOPLE CONSIDERED THE

00:02:18.365 --> 00:02:19.698
AMBITIONS, THE THOUGHT WAS

00:02:19.699 --> 00:02:22.101
MINISTER FARRAKHAN AND HIS

00:02:22.102 --> 00:02:23.936
REPUTATION WOULD HURT SOMEONE

00:02:23.937 --> 00:02:27.773
TRYING TO WIN ACCEPTANCE IN THE

00:02:27.774 --> 00:02:28.907
BROAD CROSS SECTION.

00:02:28.908 --> 00:02:32.177
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DID HE HAVE CONTACT

00:02:32.178 --> 00:02:34.880
WITH ANYONE FROM THE NATION OF

00:02:34.881 --> 00:02:37.549
ISLAM AS SENATOR THAT YOU KNOW

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:37.850
OF?

00:02:37.851 --> 00:02:39.451
&gt;&gt; AS I RECALL THERE WAS A

00:02:39.452 --> 00:02:43.956
MEMBER OF THE NATION OF ISLAM IN

00:02:43.957 --> 00:02:47.993
CHICAGO WORKED ON HIS STAFF IN

00:02:47.994 --> 00:02:49.695
HIS CONSTITUENT SERVICES OFFICE

00:02:49.696 --> 00:02:57.336
BUT I NEVER KNEW HER NAME.

00:02:57.337 --> 00:03:00.239
AT SOME POINT SHE WAS NO LONGER

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.306
ON HIS STAFF.

00:03:06.713 --> 00:03:07.880
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WERE LOUIS FARRAKHAN

00:03:07.881 --> 00:03:12.551
OR MEMBERS OF THE NATION OFFEND

00:03:12.552 --> 00:03:13.986
PRESIDENT OBAMA WANTED TO

00:03:13.987 --> 00:03:15.654
DISTANCE HIMSELF.

00:03:15.655 --> 00:03:16.388
&gt;&gt; THEY WERE.

00:03:16.389 --> 00:03:19.691
SOME WERE ANGRY AND SOME HURT.

00:03:19.692 --> 00:03:22.261
NOT ONLY DID SENATOR OBAMA

00:03:22.262 --> 00:03:23.629
DENOUNCE MINISTER FARRAKHAN BUT

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:24.797
REJECTED HIM.

00:03:24.798 --> 00:03:29.768
IN THE SAME INTERVIEW APPEARING

00:03:29.769 --> 00:03:37.309
WITH SENATOR CLINTON.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:40.179
WHEN ASKED REJECTED THE SUPPORT

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:42.414
OF SOME PEOPLE SHE CONSIDERED IN

00:03:42.415 --> 00:03:43.415
NEW YORK WHEN SHE WAS IN THE

00:03:43.416 --> 00:03:45.284
SENATE AND DEMANDED HE DO THE

00:03:45.285 --> 00:03:45.584
SAME.

00:03:45.585 --> 00:03:47.386
HE SAID, OKAY.

00:03:47.387 --> 00:03:52.658
I'LL REJECT HIM TOO.

00:03:52.659 --> 00:03:54.493
SO PEOPLE IN THE NATION HAVE A

00:03:54.494 --> 00:03:56.562
SENSITIVITY ABOUT THIS AND FEEL

00:03:56.563 --> 00:03:59.498
WE'VE OFTEN BEEN MADE --

00:03:59.499 --> 00:04:01.200
MINISTER FARRAKHAN HAS BEEN A

00:04:04.938 --> 00:04:07.873
PEOPLE WHO WANT THE

00:04:14.481 --> 00:04:16.982
BEING ASSOCIATED WITH MINISTER

00:04:16.983 --> 00:04:17.349
FARRAKHAN.

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:18.917
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I WISH IT'D COME OUT

00:04:18.918 --> 00:04:19.985
EARLIER BECAUSE IT MAKES FOR AN

00:04:19.986 --> 00:04:22.122
INTERESTING CONVERSATION.

